- **q40: cap → Episode Settings** (default 2) — not yet built (revision cap currently hardcoded 2 in critic-loop).
- **fal-wan aspect fix** (drop aspect_ratio, add resolution, aspect from input image) — needs 1 confirm re-test (~$0.25).
- **T2 world/spatial continuity** — big separate track. Audit done: CHK-W08 specified but NOT implemented; Bible has no structured geometry; no image/video critic checks spatial layout. Invariant vanishes after text. Director: "wider than one room", defer.

