## Exact Next Step

Fix the **CREAD double-fire**: storyboard approval currently fires CREAD via two paths (factory isCriticChain on exec-sb nextEvent + computeNextEvents STB branch). Pick ONE (likely keep the factory critic-chain, remove/guard the computeNextEvents STB→CREAD fire, or tighten idempotency so the grace-window race can't double-fire). Verify trio + replay 30/30. Then clean E06 re-run (unfreeze: mode 4, raise ceiling, keep C1_STOP_BEFORE_EREF on) to watch CREAD converge (PASS or HALT-at-cap), and have Director judge the storyboard's humor readability.

